# #272/#271: a real engine save of a world that has never founded a city. Before the fix every
# save before founding threw "growth envelope is not bounded and writable" from the dormant
# lifecycle book. The verb requires the pristine dormant books, performs the engine save with the
# SaveGameError witness armed, then reports the growth-free v5 frame the live book chose. On a
# writer without the fix the engine save itself refuses; retain that failed run as evidence that
# this persona detects the defect. No founding, no reload claim; see unfounded-reload.persona.
# The #283 readmission line is forbidden like every regression persona's on the fixed build.
DESCRIPTION=an unfounded world saves through the engine and its dormant lifecycle book takes the v5 frame
REQUEST=arch-gallery-slice;facing=north
SCRIPT=stagedigest;unfounded-save;stagedigest
VERBS=unfounded-save
EXPECT=stagedigest:OK~founded=false,unfounded-save:OK~real-save=true dormant-frame=5,stagedigest:OK~founded=false,COMPLETE
LOG_FORBID=["growth envelope is not bounded and writable","exception serializing object","improvement readmitted:"]
SET=save-load,native-regression
TIMEOUT=600
